{"id":"nb62076ff88","headline":"'Harmonised, interoperable mechanisms': G7 takes on China’s critical minerals dominance, sets 2030 target to cut dependence","summary":"G7 leaders agreed to coordinate stockpiling, boost recycling and create a new platform with an expanded role for the International Energy Agency. The aim is to reduce dependence on China for critical minerals by 2030.","why":"Critical minerals such as lithium, cobalt and rare earths are essential to batteries, electronics and defence, and China dominates their processing.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"trade","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Evian-les-Bains","country":"France","lat":46.402,"lon":6.588,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/international-business/harmonised-interoperable-mechanisms-g7-takes-on-chinas-critical-minerals-dominance-sets-2030-target-to-cut-dependence/articleshow/131807560.cms"},"sources":[{"name":"The Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/international-business/harmonised-interoperable-mechanisms-g7-takes-on-chinas-critical-minerals-dominance-sets-2030-target-to-cut-dependence/articleshow/131807560.cms"}],"published_at":"2026-06-17T17:22:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T13:38:59Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"badb089e170c18aa","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T13:38:59Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-06-17T17:22:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-06-17T18:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"CH","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/copper-mine-7721472.jpg","alt":"copper mine (illustration)","credit":"ignartonosbg","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixaba